From e18f4527f690a2cac3460c876a753e8905e0371b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 07:17:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add secure lock screen controls

While Settings.Secure lockscreen_secure_controls is 1 and the device is
locked behind a PIN, pattern or password, don't open the power menu,
and have the internet, Wi-Fi, mobile data, Bluetooth, airplane mode,
hotspot, location and NFC tiles ask for an unlock before a click or
toggle goes through, for both the legacy and the new tile classes. A
locked phone then can't be switched off or taken off the network.

Change-Id: I68af60c8212efae76b125a403460330ed7204b18
